
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.AgentInExperience(AgentID: uuid): boolean`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer llAgentInExperience(key AgentID);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Determines whether or not the specified <b>agent</b> is in the script's experience.</p>
  <p>Returns a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/boolean" target="_blank">boolean</a> (an <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">integer</a>) that is <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TRUE" target="_blank">TRUE</a> if the <b>agent</b> is in the experience and the experience can run in the current region.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>uuid</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>key</span></td>
          <td>AgentID / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/agent" target="_blank">agent</a></td>
          <td>avatar <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/UUID" target="_blank">UUID</a> that is in the same <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Region" target="_blank">region</a>&#32;to query.</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>avatar</li>
        <li>experience</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">392</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-mandatory">Use Return</span>
        <span class="attr-label bg-experience">Experience</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Agent must be over a parcel that has the Experience allowed or FALSE is returned with Land Scope Experience compiled scripts.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll = llcompat

function LLEvents.touch_start(events)
    local total_number = #events
    if ll.AgentInExperience(ll.DetectedKey(0)) ~= 0 then
        ll.OwnerSay(ll.DetectedName(0) .. " is in my experience")
    else
        ll.OwnerSay(ll.DetectedName(0) .. " is not in my experience")
    end
end
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`default
{
  touch_start(integer total_number)
  {
    if(llAgentInExperience(llDetectedKey(0)))
    {
      llOwnerSay(llDetectedName(0)+ " is in my experience");
    }
    else
    {
      llOwnerSay(llDetectedName(0)+ " is not in my experience");
    }
  } 
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
